r music and art and way to escape  [Music]  and I just made a music video actually  in this room Margo price shot the video  for her new single letting me down with  a small socially distanced crew  [Music]  you have to try to make something good  out of something bad and in my life  that's kind of always been the pattern  tragedy and then processing and the  therapy of making it into art that's how  rumors get started comes out July 10th
 

